OL,3,AManchester Arena survivor says 'I
OL,4,Athought life was over' on UK's first
OL,5,Anational day for terror victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism,
OL,9,Fincluding survivors and their families,
OL,10,Fwitnesses and the emergency services
OL,12,FA ceremony, including readings and a
OL,13,Ftwo-minute silence, is taking place now
OL,14,F- watch live above
OL,16,FAn art installation, made of 1,000
OL,17,Fpaper cranes, has been set up at the
OL,18,Fvenue - here's why
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
